## Step 4: Pareto Analysis of Reliable Candidates

Looking at the confirmed multi-specimen results with good quality:

The best balance of high modulus + reasonable pore fraction from reliable measurements:
- **17-0add-5deg-30s-N2-1200s_run2**: Modulus=547, PF=0.311, CV=0.112 — good quality, but only 1 independent synthesis
- **17p5-0add-25deg-375s-N2-1300s**: Modulus=592, PF=0.283, CV=0.109 — good quality, 1 synthesis
